{
  "name": "Media Tools MCP - Subscriber Care",
  "displayName": "Media Tools MCP - Subscriber Care",
  "description": "Media Subscriber Care: look up subscribers, plans, devices, charges, playback errors, regional title rights and watch history; change or pause plans, remove devices, open cases and credit charges (gateway limit $50). No content finance or audience analytics.",
